{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Meshelemiah’s [Bb/D]lineage clear
[Cm7]Firstborn Zechariah [Bb]stands here
[Ab]Jediael is the second name
[Bb]Zebadiah takes the third claim
[Cm]Jathniel [Bb]the fourth in [Ab]line
Levitical [Bb]gatekeepers [Eb]shine
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Ab]Standing at the [Bb]door so [Eb]wide
[Ab]Serving at the [Bb]Lord’s house in[Cm]side [Cm7/Bb]
[Ab]Guarding [Bb]the threshold [Cm]with [Bb][Ab]care
David’s e[Bb]ra, faithful [Eb]share
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [Eb] | [Bb/D] | [Cm7] | [Cm7] |
| [Ab] | [Ab] | [Bb] | [Bb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
With [Eb]Jaaziel and [Bb/D]others there
In the [Cm7]watch service, [Bb6]the prayer
[Ab]Temple gates they keep secure
[Bb]In their duty, in their cure
[Cm]Levitical [Bb6]blood runs [Ab]strong
Singing the [Bb]songs that are [Eb]sung
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Ab]Standing at the [Bb]door so [Eb]wide
[Ab]Serving at the [Bb]Lord’s house in[Cm]side [Cm7/Bb]
[Ab]Guarding the [Bb]threshold with [Cm][Bb][Ab]care
David’s e[Bb]ra, faithful [Eb]share
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [Eb] | [Eb] | [Bb/D] | [Bb/D] | [Cm] | [Cm] | [Ab] | [Ab] | ×2

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Names written [Bb]in the [Eb]scroll
[Ab]Guardians of the ho[Bb]ly [Cm7]role [Cm7/Bb]
[Ab]Zechariah leads [Bb]the [Cm7][Bb][Ab]way
In the [Bb]light of the [Eb]day
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Ab]Firstborn [Bb]son, [Cm]stan[Bb]ding [Ab]firm
Serving the Lord, [Bb]keeping the [Eb]arm
{end_of_verse}

